 "questions": [
  {
   "id": 513237,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Solve the system by graphing:\n<br>\n<span data-math=\"\\left\\{ {\\begin{array}{*{20}{l}} {3x - 2y \\geq 12} \\\\  {y \\geq \\frac{3}{2}x + 1} \\end{array}} \\right.\">\\left\\{ {\\begin{array}{*{20}{l}} {3x - 2y \\geq 12} \\\\  {y \\geq \\frac{3}{2}x + 1} \\end{array}} \\right.</span>",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p><span data-math=\"3x - 2y \\ge 12\"></span></p>\n<p>Graph the first line as a solid line using the intercepts <span data-math=\"\\left( {4,0} \\right)\"></span> and <span data-math=\"\\left( {0, - 6} \\right)\"></span>.</p>\n<table class=\"unnumbered unstyled\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Test (0, 0).</td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-math=\"\\left( 0 \\right)x - 2\\left( 0 \\right) \\ge 12\"></span></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-math=\"0 \\ge 12\"></span></td>\n<td>This is false. Shade lightly the side where (0, 0) is not located.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-math=\"y \\ge \\frac{3}{2}x + 1\"></span></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>Graph the second line as a solid line using the intercept <span data-math=\"\\left( {0,1} \\right)\"></span>and the slope of <span data-math=\"\\frac{3}{2}\"></span>.</p>\n<table class=\"unnumbered unstyled\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Test (0, 0).</td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-math=\"0 \\ge \\frac{3}{2}\\left( 0 \\right) + 1\"></span></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-math=\"0 \\ge 1\"></span></td>\n<td>This is not true. Shade lightly the side where (0, 0) is not located.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>There is no overlap in this graph, no shared points There is no solution.</p>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "No solution. <br>\n<img src=\"https://exercises.openstax.org/rails/active_storage/blobs/proxy/eyJfcmFpbHMiOnsibWVzc2FnZSI6IkJBaHBBcmdLIiwiZXhwIjpudWxsLCJwdXIiOiJibG9iX2lkIn19--80a3c4c7eeb1876dc8014d2b14dae2b8034c460e/CS_Figure_05_10_011.jpg\" alt=\"Two lines are plotted on a coordinate plane. The horizontal and vertical axes range from negative 10 to 10, in increments of 1. The first line passes through the points, (negative 6, negative 8), (0, 1), and (4, 7). The region above the line is shaded in gray. The second line passes through the points, (negative 2, negative 9), (0, negative 6), (4, 0), and (10, 9). The region below the line is shaded in blue.\">"
    }
